{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Search for object, approach it, move it, check its properties, perform task. If not found, scan area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = GraspObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextArea    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsAreaScanned    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = TaskSpecificSubtree    />\"",
